\f0\fs24 \cf0 I want you to build a complete "Second Brain" knowledge vault in this directory. It will be operated entirely through Claude Code sessions and must also open cleanly as an Obsidian vault. This session has three phases: (1) build the full folder structure, a thin root CLAUDE.md router, and a set of project skills that contain the actual workflows; (2) interview me to seed the vault with my basic information and reshape the structure around my life; (3) teach me how to use it with a printed usage guide. Details below.\
